-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;This is where you can edit your app settings. The VESC can run one or more apps, and the apps are used to enable different functions on the communication interfaces of the VESC. If you are going to use your VESC with USB or CAN-bus you don't have to change the app configuration since these interfaces always are active. If you want to use conventional input devices such as nunchuks, ebike throttles or RC remote controllers you have to configure the apps accordingly.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;在这里可以编辑你的 app 设置。VESC 可以运行一个或多个 app，app 用于启用 VESC 各通信接口上的不同功能。如果你只通过 USB 或 CAN 总线使用 VESC，就不必改动 app 配置，因为这两个接口始终是开启的。如果要使用双节棍手柄、电动车油门把手或航模遥控这类常规输入设备，就必须相应地配置 app。&lt;/p&gt;
