             <type>1</type>
             <transmittable>1</transmittable>
             <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
 &lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
 p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
 &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto'; ; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Stator saturation compensation.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;定子饱和补偿。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;When using high currents the stator of the motor can get saturated. This will change the motor parameters, making it difficult for the sensorless observer to track the rotor position. The effect is most noticeable when running the motor with high current at low speed - it will get stuck and then &amp;quot;cog&amp;quot; when open loop operation tries to restart the motor. If you observe this behavior you can try to increase this parameter. This parameter attempts to compensate for effects of stator saturation, making it possible to run motors sensorlessly even at high current and low speed.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;使用大电流时电机定子可能进入饱和。这会改变电机参数，使无感观测器难以跟踪转子位置。该现象在低速大电流运行时最明显——电机会卡住，随后在开环试图重新起动时出现&amp;quot;顿挫&amp;quot;（cog）。如果观察到这种现象，可以试着调大该参数。这个参数试图补偿定子饱和的影响，让电机即使在大电流低速下也能无感运行。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Reasonable values for this parameters are 15 % or less. If going higher than that gives good results something else is most likely wrong in your configuration.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;该参数的合理取值在 15 % 以内。如果调得更高才有好效果，那多半是配置里别的地方有问题。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Consider the following:&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;请注意以下几点：&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Motors that run at low speed and high torque tend to get saturated, such as e-bike direct drive hub motors.&lt;/li&gt;
-&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Coreless motors should in theory never get saturated.&lt;/li&gt;
-&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;The effect of this parameter is proportional to the maximum motor current limit, meaning that this parameter has no effect at zero current and full effect at full current. If you change the maximum motor current limit you have to adapt this parameter accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
+&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;低速大转矩运行的电机容易饱和，比如电动自行车的直驱轮毂电机。&lt;/li&gt;
+&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;无铁芯电机理论上永远不会饱和。&lt;/li&gt;
+&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;该参数的作用与电机最大电流限值成正比：零电流时完全不起作用，满电流时作用最大。如果改了电机最大电流限值，就要相应地调整这个参数。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
