             <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
 &lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
 p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
 &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto'; ; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;This enables the use of phase voltage filters on hardware that supports it. Instead of calculating the phase voltage from the input voltage and modulation, it is measured directly by low-pass filtering the power stage output. The advantage of doing so is that it eliminates dead-time distortion, which helps track the motor at very low speeds. It should also be very useful on hardware with an IGBT output stage, as it compensated for the effect of IGBT voltage drop too.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;在支持的硬件上启用相电压滤波器。这样相电压不再由输入电压和调制度推算，而是通过对功率级输出做低通滤波直接测得。好处是消除了死区畸变，有助于在极低转速下跟踪电机。在 IGBT 输出级的硬件上也应当很有用，因为它同时补偿了 IGBT 压降的影响。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
             <cDefine>MCCONF_FOC_PHASE_FILTER_ENABLE</cDefine>
             <valInt>1</valInt>
         </foc_phase_filter_enable>
         <foc_phase_filter_disable_fault>
-            <longName>Disable Phase Filter Fault Code</longName>
+            <longName>禁用相位滤波器故障码（Disable Phase Filter Fault Code）</longName>
             <type>5</type>
             <transmittable>1</transmittable>
             <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
 &lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
 p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
 &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto'; ; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Disable the phase filter fault code. This can be useful if the phase filter fault seems to trigger for no reason on some difficult motors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;禁用相位滤波器故障码。当某些难搞的电机上该故障看似无缘无故触发时，这个选项会有用。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
             <cDefine>MCCONF_FOC_PHASE_FILTER_DISABLE_FAULT</cDefine>
             <valInt>1</valInt>
         </foc_phase_filter_disable_fault>
         <foc_phase_filter_max_erpm>
-            <longName>Maximum ERPM for phase filters</longName>
+            <longName>相位滤波器最高电气转速（Maximum ERPM for phase filters）</longName>
             <type>1</type>
             <transmittable>1</transmittable>
             <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
 &lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
 p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
 &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto'; ; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Use the filtered phase voltage up until this ERPM, then use the value derived from the input voltage and the modulation. The delay and attenuation from the phase filters increases with the motor speed, while the dead-time distortion becomes less significant. The delay and attenuation is partly compensated for, but at some point it is still better to derive the phase voltages from the input voltage and modulation. This parameter sets that point.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;在该电气转速（ERPM）以内使用滤波后的相电压，超过之后改用由输入电压和调制度推算的值。相位滤波器带来的延时与衰减随转速升高而加大，而死区畸变的影响则变小。延时与衰减虽有部分补偿，但到某个点之后，还是由输入电压和调制度推算相电压更好。这个参数就是设定那个切换点。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
             <cDefine>MCCONF_FOC_PHASE_FILTER_MAX_ERPM</cDefine>
             <editorDecimalsDouble>0</editorDecimalsDouble>
             <editorScale>1</editorScale>
@@ -2843,42 +2898,45 @@
