         </foc_phase_filter_max_erpm>
         <foc_mtpa_mode>
-            <longName>MTPA Algorithm Mode</longName>
+            <longName>MTPA 算法模式（MTPA Algorithm Mode）</longName>
             <type>4</type>
             <transmittable>1</transmittable>
             <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
 &lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
 p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
 &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto'; ; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;This parameter will enable the Maximum Torque Per Amp (MTPA) algorithm that injects a negative d axis current to follow the optimum torque trajectory. This is specially valuable on Interior Permanent Magnet (IPM) motors because they have large saliency and can yield a substantial torque increase.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;该参数启用最大转矩电流比（MTPA）算法：注入负的 d 轴电流以沿最优转矩轨迹运行。对内嵌式永磁电机（IPM）尤其有价值，因为它们凸极性大，转矩提升可观。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;The available modes are:&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;可选模式如下：&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Disabled&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;This disables the MTPA algorithm.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;禁用&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;关闭 MTPA 算法。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;IQ Target&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;The D-axis current is based on the set Q-axis current. This makes the target value less noisy, but relies on the current controller keeping keeping the Q-axis current close to the set value. This mode does not work well with duty cycle control.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;IQ 给定值&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;D 轴电流依据设定的 Q 轴电流计算。这样目标值噪声较小，但依赖电流环把 Q 轴电流稳在设定值附近。该模式在占空比控制下表现不佳。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;IQ Measured&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;The D-axis current is based on the measured Q-axis current. The commanded D-axis current will be more affected by noise, but it does not rely on the Q-axis current controller to keep the current at the set value.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;IQ 实测值&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;D 轴电流依据实测的 Q 轴电流计算。给定的 D 轴电流受噪声影响更大，但不依赖 Q 轴电流环把电流稳在设定值。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Note:&lt;/span&gt; Only enable this feature if you know very well what you are doing. IPM motors are not popular and injecting negative id current can increase the motor speed. If id current suddenly collapses (under a fault condition for example) the DC Bus voltage can increase well beyond the powerstage rating causing a fire and maximum braking power at the motor shaft.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;注意：&lt;/span&gt; 只有在非常清楚自己在做什么的情况下才启用该功能。IPM 电机并不常见，注入负的 id 电流会提高电机转速。如果 id 电流突然消失（例如出现故障时），直流母线电压可能远超功率级耐压，引发起火，同时电机轴上出现最大制动力。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
             <cDefine>MCCONF_FOC_MTPA_MODE</cDefine>
             <valInt>0</valInt>
-            <enumNames>Disabled</enumNames>
-            <enumNames>IQ Target</enumNames>
-            <enumNames>IQ Measured</enumNames>
+            <enumNames>禁用</enumNames>
+            <enumNames>IQ 给定值</enumNames>
+            <enumNames>IQ 实测值</enumNames>
+            <enumNamesSig>Disabled</enumNamesSig>
+            <enumNamesSig>IQ Target</enumNamesSig>
+            <enumNamesSig>IQ Measured</enumNamesSig>
         </foc_mtpa_mode>
