-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot;&gt;Give the q axis current this much of the field weakening current as braking current (opposite to the current direction). This helps slow the motor down when commanding 0 current in case the position has an offset and the field weakening current contributes with torque.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
