-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;For measuring the flux linkage the motor needs to spin up, which is controlled by the &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;I&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;D&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;ω&lt;/span&gt; startup settings. Notice that the resistance has to be measured first. The startup settings mean the following:&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;测量磁链时电机需要转起来，这由 &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;I&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;D&lt;/span&gt; 和 &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;ω&lt;/span&gt; 起动设置控制。注意必须先测出电阻。起动设置的含义如下：&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Current (I)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;The current to use for spinning up the motor.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;电流 (I)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;把电机转起来所使用的电流。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Duty (D)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;The duty cycle where to measure the flux linkage.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;占空比 (D)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;测量磁链时使用的占空比。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;ERPM (ω)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;The minimum speed for the delay commutation mode to start the motor.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;电气转速 (ω)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;延时换相模式起动电机所需的最低转速。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;If the motor is not able to spin up properly these settings can be tweaked. Symptoms:&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;如果电机无法正常升速，可以调整这些设置。常见症状：&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;The motor starts to spin, but is too weak to reach enough speed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;电机开始转动，但力量不足，达不到需要的转速。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Increase the current setting.&lt;/li&gt;
-&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;If the load increases with speed (e.g. a propeller) you can decrease the duty cycle. This makes the detection slightly less accurate, but that does not matter in general.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
+&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;调大电流设置。&lt;/li&gt;
+&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;如果负载随转速增加（例如螺旋桨），可以把占空比调低。这会让检测精度略有下降，但一般无关紧要。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;The motor cogs and is unable to spin up.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;电机顿挫，转不起来。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;Increase or decrease the current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
-&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;If the motor has high inertia decrease ERPM. E-bike hub motors tend to have high inertia.&lt;/li&gt;
-&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;If the motor has low inertia increase ERPM.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
+&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;调大或调小电流。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
+&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;如果电机惯量大，就调低 ERPM。电动自行车轮毂电机通常惯量较大。&lt;/li&gt;
+&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;如果电机惯量小，就调高 ERPM。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;After measuring the motor parameters, gain factors for the current PI control loop and the observer gain should be calculated. KP and KI are calculated based on a desired time constant of the current controller and the motor parameters R and L, which have to be measured first. The observer gain is calculated based on the motor inductance, which also has to be measured first.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;测出电机参数之后，应当计算电流 PI 环的增益系数和观测器增益。KP 和 KI 由期望的电流环时间常数以及电机参数 R、L 算出，因此必须先测出 R 和 L。观测器增益由电机电感算出，同样必须先测出电感。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
             <cDefine></cDefine>
         </help_foc_detect>
         <help_foc_encoder_detect>
-            <longName>Detect FOC Encoder Parameters</longName>
+            <longName>检测 FOC 编码器参数（Detect FOC Encoder Parameters）</longName>
             <type>0</type>
             <transmittable>1</transmittable>
             <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
 &lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
 p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
 &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto'; ; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot;&gt;Detect the following encoder parameters:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot;&gt;检测以下编码器参数：&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:'Roboto';&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Offset&lt;/li&gt;
-&lt;li style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Ratio&lt;/li&gt;
-&lt;li style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Inverted&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
+&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;零点偏置&lt;/li&gt;
+&lt;li style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;传动比&lt;/li&gt;
+&lt;li style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;是否反向&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:'Roboto';&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot;&gt;To do that, the motor is turned slowly in open loop while the encoder output is sampled, once for the ratio and once for the offset. This is done in both directions for one full mechanical revolution to get rid off possible offsets and nonlinearities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot;&gt;做法是让电机以开环方式缓慢旋转，同时采样编码器输出，一次用于求传动比、一次用于求零点偏置。两个方向各转一整圈机械角，以消除可能的偏置和非线性。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
             <cDefine></cDefine>
         </help_foc_encoder_detect>
         <help_foc_hall_detect>
-            <longName>Detect FOC Hall Sensor Parameters</longName>
+            <longName>检测 FOC 霍尔传感器参数（Detect FOC Hall Sensor Parameters）</longName>
             <type>0</type>
             <transmittable>1</transmittable>
             <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
 &lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
 p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
 &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto'; ; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot;&gt;Detect the hall sensor table. To do that, the motor is turned slowly in open loop while the hall sensor outputs are sampled. This is done in both directions to get rid of offsets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot;&gt;检测霍尔传感器表。做法是让电机以开环方式缓慢旋转，同时采样霍尔传感器输出。正反两个方向各做一次以消除偏置。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
             <cDefine></cDefine>
         </help_foc_hall_detect>
         <help_nrf_pair>
-            <longName>NRF Pairing</longName>
+            <longName>NRF 配对（NRF Pairing）</longName>
             <type>0</type>
             <transmittable>1</transmittable>
             <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
 &lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
 p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
 &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto'; ; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Set the VESC in NRF pairing mode for the amount of time specified in the Time box (default 10 seconds). Afer that, you should put the device to pair in pairing mode before the time runs out. A popup should appear and show that pairing was successful, or that it timed out. After a sucessful pairing, the NRF settings will be updated according to the unique ID of the paired NRF device and stored to the VESC.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;让 VESC 进入 NRF 配对模式，持续时间由 Time 输入框指定（默认 10 秒）。在此期间，你需要把待配对的设备也切到配对模式。随后会弹窗提示配对成功或超时。配对成功后，NRF 设置会按已配对 NRF 设备的唯一 ID 更新并保存到 VESC。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;NRF Nunchuk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;For pairing the NRF nunchuk, set the VESC in pairing mode and switch on a nunchuk (that was switched off previously) before the pairing time runs out.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;NRF 双节棍手柄&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;要配对 NRF 双节棍手柄，先让 VESC 进入配对模式，然后在配对时间用完之前打开一个（此前处于关闭状态的）手柄。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Notice that the unique ID of the NRF nunchuk is based on a hashed version of its microcontroller UUID, so the pairing should still be valid even after updating firmware. The chance of collisions between NRF nunchuks is practically non-existent.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;注意 NRF 手柄的唯一 ID 是由其单片机 UUID 哈希得来的，因此升级固件后配对仍然有效。不同 NRF 手柄之间发生碰撞的概率实际上为零。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
             <cDefine></cDefine>
         </help_nrf_pair>
         <help_can_forward>
-            <longName>CAN Forwarding</longName>
+            <longName>CAN 转发（CAN Forwarding）</longName>
             <type>0</type>
             <transmittable>1</transmittable>
             <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
 &lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
 p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
 &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto'; ; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;When CAN forwarding is enabled, all communication will be forwarded over CAN bus to the VESC with the ID selected in the ID box in the connection page.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;启用 CAN 转发后，所有通信都会通过 CAN 总线转发给连接页面 ID 框中所选 ID 的那台 VESC。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
             <cDefine></cDefine>
         </help_can_forward>
         <help_rt_logging>
-            <longName>RT data logging</longName>
+            <longName>实时数据记录（RT data logging）</longName>
             <type>0</type>
