-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;The full motor configuration, including the notes you make on the &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Description&lt;/span&gt; page, can also be written to and read from XML files using the &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;File&lt;/span&gt; menu. This is a good way to keep your settings when going between different VESC Tool versions, to share your settings and to store your configuration in general.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;完整的电机配置——包括你在 &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;说明&lt;/span&gt; 页写下的备注——也可以通过 &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;文件&lt;/span&gt; 菜单写入 XML 文件或从 XML 文件读取。在不同 VESC Tool 版本之间迁移设置、分享设置或者单纯做配置备份，这都是个好办法。&lt;/p&gt;
