-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;The easiest way to configure your VESC for conventional input devices is to use the &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Input Setup Wizard&lt;/span&gt;. This wizard can be accessed from the welcome page, from the help menu or using the button at the bottom of this page.&lt;/p&gt;
