         <app_adc.info>
-            <longName>App ADC Information</longName>
+            <longName>ADC App 说明（App ADC Information）</longName>
             <type>0</type>
             <transmittable>1</transmittable>
             <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
 &lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
 p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
 &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto'; ; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot;&gt;The cruise control button will maintain the current speed while pressed when current control is used and no throttle is given. The reverse button is used to reverse the throttle when one of the corresponding control modes is used.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot;&gt;使用电流控制且没有给油门时，按住定速巡航按钮会维持当前速度。倒车按钮用于在选择了相应控制模式时反转油门方向。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:'Roboto';&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot;&gt;When only the ADC app is used, the TX pin is used for the cruise control button and the RX pin is used for the reverse button. When the ADC and UART apps are used at the same time, the servo input will be used as the button. In this case it will be used for the reverse button when a control mode with button is selected, otherwise it will be used for the cruise control button.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot;&gt;只使用 ADC app 时，TX 脚用作定速巡航按钮，RX 脚用作倒车按钮。若同时使用 ADC 和 UART app，则改用舵机输入作为按钮：此时若选择了带按钮的控制模式，它就是倒车按钮，否则就是定速巡航按钮。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
             <cDefine></cDefine>
         </app_adc.info>
         <app_chuk.info>
-            <longName>Chuk Info</longName>
+            <longName>双节棍手柄说明（Chuk Info）</longName>
             <type>0</type>
             <transmittable>1</transmittable>
             <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
 &lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
 p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
 &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto'; ; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;This app has been tested with the wireless Nyko Kama nunchuk. The receiver can be connected directly to the I2C port on the ESC. The y-axis on the joystick is used for acceleration/braking. The buttons have the following functions:&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;该 app 在无线 Nyko Kama 双节棍手柄上做过测试。接收器可以直接接到电调的 I2C 口。摇杆的 y 轴用于加速/制动。按键功能如下：&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;C-Button:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Cruise control. If the C-button is pressed, the ESC will maintail the current speed with a PID control loop. The joystick can still be used to accelerate and brake, but as soon as it is returned to the center position the new speed will be maintained, as long as the C-button remains pressed.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;C 键：&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;定速巡航。按住 C 键时，电调会用 PID 控制环维持当前速度。摇杆仍可用于加速和制动，但只要回到中位，只要 C 键还按着，就会维持新的速度。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Z-Button:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;The Z-button is used to change the direction of the motor if reverse is activated. Without reverse, Z has no effect.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Z 键：&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;启用倒车后，Z 键用于切换电机方向。未启用倒车时，Z 键无作用。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;There is also a safety function. If nothing received from the nunchuk (including the accelerometers) changes for longer than the timeout value in the &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;APP General&lt;/span&gt; page, the timeout function will be activated and either release the motor or brake with the current specified next to the timeout value.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;还有一个安全功能：如果来自手柄的所有数据（包括加速度计）在超过 &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;APP 通用&lt;/span&gt; 页设定的超时时间内都没有变化，就会触发超时功能，要么松开电机，要么按超时值旁边指定的电流进行制动。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
             <cDefine></cDefine>
         </app_chuk.info>
         <app_ppm_mapping_help>
-            <longName>PPM Pulselength Mapping</longName>
+            <longName>PPM 脉宽映射（PPM Pulselength Mapping）</longName>
             <type>0</type>
             <transmittable>1</transmittable>
             <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
 &lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
 p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
 &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto'; ; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;PPM pulselength mapping is used to map the minimum and maximum throttle values from the PPM remote to the minimum and maximum throttle values of the motor controller. The following procedure can be used:&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;PPM 脉宽映射用于把遥控器油门的最小值和最大值，映射到电机控制器的最小和最大油门值。可按以下步骤操作：&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Activate the PPM app and write the configuration.&lt;/li&gt;
-&lt;li style=&quot;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Set the PPM control mode to disabled to avoid motor movement and write the configuration.&lt;/li&gt;
-&lt;li style=&quot;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Connect the remote.&lt;/li&gt;
-&lt;li style=&quot;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Activate app realtime data streaming in the main toolbar. The input display should show the decoded input value and pulse length if the remote is connected and on.&lt;/li&gt;
-&lt;li style=&quot;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Move the throttle between the minimum and maximum values to get them sampled.&lt;/li&gt;
-&lt;li style=&quot;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Apply the result.&lt;/li&gt;
-&lt;li style=&quot;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Write the configuration.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;
+&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;启用 PPM app 并写入配置。&lt;/li&gt;
+&lt;li style=&quot;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;把 PPM 控制模式设为禁用以免电机转动，并写入配置。&lt;/li&gt;
+&lt;li style=&quot;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;连接遥控器。&lt;/li&gt;
+&lt;li style=&quot;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;在主工具栏中启用 app 实时数据拉取。若遥控器已连接并开机，输入显示区应当能看到解码出的输入值和脉宽。&lt;/li&gt;
+&lt;li style=&quot;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;把油门从最小推到最大，让两端的值都被采到。&lt;/li&gt;
+&lt;li style=&quot;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;应用结果。&lt;/li&gt;
+&lt;li style=&quot;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;写入配置。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Input mapping should also be usable for those oneshot pulselengths that are popular for some multirotor flight controllers that don't have support for proper ESC communication such as CAN-bus or UART.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;输入映射同样适用于某些多旋翼飞控常用的 oneshot 脉宽——这类飞控不支持 CAN 总线或 UART 之类的正规电调通信。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
             <cDefine></cDefine>
