 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;V0 and V7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Sample currents and voltages in both V0 and V7 and run the full control loop at twice the rate. Can be useful for high speed motors at limited switching frequency, or in order to decrease the modulation noise. Notice that this option will require twice the amount of computational power for a given switching frequency.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;V0 与 V7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;在 V0 和 V7 中都采样电流与电压，并以两倍速率运行完整控制环。在开关频率受限的高速电机上，或者为了降低调制噪声时会有用。注意：在同样的开关频率下，该选项需要两倍的运算量。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;This mode is only valid for hardware with phase shunts, such as the VESC Six. For other shunt configurations it is ignored.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;该模式只适用于带相电流采样电阻的硬件，例如 VESC Six。其它采样电阻方案会忽略该设置。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;V0 and V7 Interpolation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Regular sampling and control in V0 and advance the voltage vector with interpolation in V7. This can help motors run better at high speeds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;V0 与 V7 插值&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;在 V0 中正常采样并做控制，在 V7 中用插值推进电压矢量。这有助于电机在高速下运行得更好。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
             <cDefine>MCCONF_FOC_CONTROL_SAMPLE_MODE</cDefine>
             <valInt>0</valInt>
-            <enumNames>V0 Only</enumNames>
-            <enumNames>V0 and V7</enumNames>
-            <enumNames>V0 and V7 Interpolation</enumNames>
+            <enumNames>仅 V0</enumNames>
+            <enumNames>V0 与 V7</enumNames>
+            <enumNames>V0 与 V7 插值</enumNames>
+            <enumNamesSig>V0 Only</enumNamesSig>
+            <enumNamesSig>V0 and V7</enumNamesSig>
+            <enumNamesSig>V0 and V7 Interpolation</enumNamesSig>
         </foc_control_sample_mode>
         <foc_current_sample_mode>
-            <longName>Current Sample Mode</longName>
+            <longName>电流采样模式（Current Sample Mode）</longName>
             <type>4</type>
             <transmittable>1</transmittable>
             <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
 &lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
 p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
 &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto'; ; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Longest Zero Time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Pick the two sensors that spend the longest time in the zero vectors and calculate the third current from them. This can help reduce noise and gives low side shunt hardware more time to rise before the sample is taken on high modulation. &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Note&lt;/span&gt;: When this mode is selected, &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;All Sensors Combined&lt;/span&gt; will be used on low modulation up until a timer compare value of 900 counts, which corresponds to around 70% duty cycle on 30 kHz zero vector frequency. This is done because HFI works much better then and also because combining all sensors generally gives better samples when the avalible sampling time is longer.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;最长零矢量时间&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;挑选停留在零矢量中时间最长的两个传感器，再由它们算出第三相电流。这有助于降低噪声，也让下桥采样电阻硬件在高调制度下有更多时间建立信号再采样。 &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;注意&lt;/span&gt;：选择该模式时，在低调制度下（直到定时器比较值 900 计数为止，对应 30 kHz 零矢量频率下约 70% 占空比）会改用 &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;合并全部传感器&lt;/span&gt; 。这样做是因为此时 HFI 效果好得多，而且可用采样时间较长时，合并全部传感器通常能得到更好的采样。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;All Sensors Combined&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Use all three current readings and make a full Clarke transform. This helps reject common mode noise and also reduces current offsets on motors with low inductance with high current ripple.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;合并全部传感器&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;使用全部三路电流读数做完整的 Clarke 变换。这有助于抑制共模噪声，也能减小低电感、大纹波电流电机上的电流偏置。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;High Current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Choose the lowest currents during sampling to derive the highest current. Since the motor currents are balanced and sum to 0, two of the phase currents can be used to derive the third one. Enabling this option will make the current measurement compare all motor currents and derive the highest one from the two lower currents. This way higher currents can be measured than the ADC gain allows by a factor of 2 / sqrt(3), or roughly 1.15. For example, for the VESC6 this increases the current measurement capability from 165A to roughly 190A.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;大电流&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;采样时取数值最小的那些电流，反推出最大的那一相。由于电机三相电流平衡且之和为 0，用两相电流就能推出第三相。启用该选项后，电流测量会比较所有相电流，并用较小的两相推出最大的一相。这样可测的电流上限比 ADC 增益允许的值高 2/√3 倍，约 1.15 倍。例如 VESC6 的电流测量能力可从 165 A 提高到约 190 A。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;This parameter is only valid for hardware with three shunts, such as the VESC Six. For other shunt configurations it is ignored.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;注意&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;该参数只适用于三采样电阻硬件，例如 VESC Six。其它采样电阻方案会忽略该设置。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
             <cDefine>MCCONF_FOC_CURRENT_SAMPLE_MODE</cDefine>
             <valInt>0</valInt>
-            <enumNames>Longest Zero Time</enumNames>
-            <enumNames>All Sensors Combined</enumNames>
-            <enumNames>High Current</enumNames>
+            <enumNames>最长零矢量时间</enumNames>
+            <enumNames>合并全部传感器</enumNames>
+            <enumNames>大电流</enumNames>
+            <enumNamesSig>Longest Zero Time</enumNamesSig>
+            <enumNamesSig>All Sensors Combined</enumNamesSig>
+            <enumNamesSig>High Current</enumNamesSig>
         </foc_current_sample_mode>
         <foc_sat_comp_mode>
-            <longName>Saturation Compensation Mode</longName>
+            <longName>饱和补偿模式（Saturation Compensation Mode）</longName>
             <type>4</type>
             <transmittable>1</transmittable>
             <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
 &lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
 p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
 &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto'; ; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Stator Saturation Compensation Mode:&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;定子饱和补偿模式：&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Disabled&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;No saturation compensation is done.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;禁用&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;不做饱和补偿。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Factor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;The &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;Saturation Compensation Factor&lt;/span&gt; is used to determine how much to decrease the inductance and flux linkage based on the current.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;系数&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;用 &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;饱和补偿系数&lt;/span&gt; 来决定按电流把电感和磁链下调多少。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Lambda&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;The decrease in flux linkage is used to make a proportional decrease in inductance. This requires that one of the observers with Lambda Compensation is used.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;按磁链的下降量成比例地下调电感。这要求使用带 Lambda 补偿的观测器之一。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Lambda and Factor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;First the lambda compensation and then the factor is used. Also requires that one of the observers with Lambda Compensation is used.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Lambda 加系数&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;先做 lambda 补偿，再乘系数。同样要求使用带 Lambda 补偿的观测器之一。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
             <cDefine>MCCONF_FOC_SAT_COMP_MODE</cDefine>
             <valInt>2</valInt>
-            <enumNames>Disabled</enumNames>
-            <enumNames>Factor</enumNames>
+            <enumNames>禁用</enumNames>
+            <enumNames>系数</enumNames>
             <enumNames>Lambda</enumNames>
-            <enumNames>Lambda and Factor</enumNames>
+            <enumNames>Lambda 加系数</enumNames>
+            <enumNamesSig>Disabled</enumNamesSig>
+            <enumNamesSig>Factor</enumNamesSig>
+            <enumNamesSig>Lambda</enumNamesSig>
+            <enumNamesSig>Lambda and Factor</enumNamesSig>
         </foc_sat_comp_mode>
         <foc_sat_comp>
-            <longName>Saturation Compensation Factor</longName>
+            <longName>饱和补偿系数</longName>
             <type>1</type>
             <transmittable>1</transmittable>
             <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
 &lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
 p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
 &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto'; ; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Stator saturation compensation.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;定子饱和补偿。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;When using high currents the stator of the motor can get saturated. This will change the motor parameters, making it difficult for the sensorless observer to track the rotor position. The effect is most noticeable when running the motor with high current at low speed - it will get stuck and then &amp;quot;cog&amp;quot; when open loop operation tries to restart the motor. If you observe this behavior you can try to increase this parameter. This parameter attempts to compensate for effects of stator saturation, making it possible to run motors sensorlessly even at high current and low speed.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;使用大电流时电机定子可能进入饱和。这会改变电机参数，使无感观测器难以跟踪转子位置。该现象在低速大电流运行时最明显——电机会卡住，随后在开环试图重新起动时出现&amp;quot;顿挫&amp;quot;（cog）。如果观察到这种现象，可以试着调大该参数。这个参数试图补偿定子饱和的影响，让电机即使在大电流低速下也能无感运行。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Reasonable values for this parameters are 15 % or less. If going higher than that gives good results something else is most likely wrong in your configuration.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;该参数的合理取值在 15 % 以内。如果调得更高才有好效果，那多半是配置里别的地方有问题。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Consider the following:&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;请注意以下几点：&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Motors that run at low speed and high torque tend to get saturated, such as e-bike direct drive hub motors.&lt;/li&gt;
-&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Coreless motors should in theory never get saturated.&lt;/li&gt;
-&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;The effect of this parameter is proportional to the maximum motor current limit, meaning that this parameter has no effect at zero current and full effect at full current. If you change the maximum motor current limit you have to adapt this parameter accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
+&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;低速大转矩运行的电机容易饱和，比如电动自行车的直驱轮毂电机。&lt;/li&gt;
+&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;无铁芯电机理论上永远不会饱和。&lt;/li&gt;
+&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;该参数的作用与电机最大电流限值成正比：零电流时完全不起作用，满电流时作用最大。如果改了电机最大电流限值，就要相应地调整这个参数。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
