+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot;&gt;测量电机电阻时的电机温度。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
