 &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto'; ; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto';&quot;&gt;Constant for the filtered current in the FOC implementation. Will affect how fast the slow abs max current fault triggers. Range 0 to 1, where 0 is the slowest and 1 is no filtering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
