-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Only allow starting the motor when the input has beed zero for long enough after boot, after configuration updates and after faults.&lt;/p&gt;
