-            <longName>Current Sample Mode</longName>
+            <longName>电流采样模式（Current Sample Mode）</longName>
             <type>4</type>
             <transmittable>1</transmittable>
             <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
 &lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
 p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
 &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Roboto'; ; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Longest Zero Time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Pick the two sensors that spend the longest time in the zero vectors and calculate the third current from them. This can help reduce noise and gives low side shunt hardware more time to rise before the sample is taken on high modulation. &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Note&lt;/span&gt;: When this mode is selected, &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;All Sensors Combined&lt;/span&gt; will be used on low modulation up until a timer compare value of 900 counts, which corresponds to around 70% duty cycle on 30 kHz zero vector frequency. This is done because HFI works much better then and also because combining all sensors generally gives better samples when the avalible sampling time is longer.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;最长零矢量时间&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;挑选停留在零矢量中时间最长的两个传感器，再由它们算出第三相电流。这有助于降低噪声，也让下桥采样电阻硬件在高调制度下有更多时间建立信号再采样。 &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;注意&lt;/span&gt;：选择该模式时，在低调制度下（直到定时器比较值 900 计数为止，对应 30 kHz 零矢量频率下约 70% 占空比）会改用 &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;合并全部传感器&lt;/span&gt; 。这样做是因为此时 HFI 效果好得多，而且可用采样时间较长时，合并全部传感器通常能得到更好的采样。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;All Sensors Combined&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Use all three current readings and make a full Clarke transform. This helps reject common mode noise and also reduces current offsets on motors with low inductance with high current ripple.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;合并全部传感器&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;使用全部三路电流读数做完整的 Clarke 变换。这有助于抑制共模噪声，也能减小低电感、大纹波电流电机上的电流偏置。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;High Current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Choose the lowest currents during sampling to derive the highest current. Since the motor currents are balanced and sum to 0, two of the phase currents can be used to derive the third one. Enabling this option will make the current measurement compare all motor currents and derive the highest one from the two lower currents. This way higher currents can be measured than the ADC gain allows by a factor of 2 / sqrt(3), or roughly 1.15. For example, for the VESC6 this increases the current measurement capability from 165A to roughly 190A.&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;大电流&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;采样时取数值最小的那些电流，反推出最大的那一相。由于电机三相电流平衡且之和为 0，用两相电流就能推出第三相。启用该选项后，电流测量会比较所有相电流，并用较小的两相推出最大的一相。这样可测的电流上限比 ADC 增益允许的值高 2/√3 倍，约 1.15 倍。例如 VESC6 的电流测量能力可从 165 A 提高到约 190 A。&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
-&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;This parameter is only valid for hardware with three shunts, such as the VESC Six. For other shunt configurations it is ignored.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;注意&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
+&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;该参数只适用于三采样电阻硬件，例如 VESC Six。其它采样电阻方案会忽略该设置。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
